<div class="yi-markdown" style="max-inline-size: 44rem">
<h1 class="yi-heading yi-heading--4xl">Rolling out a release</h1>
<p>A rollout moves the fleet to a new revision <strong class="yi-text">one stage at a time</strong>. Each stage
waits for its hosts to report healthy before the next begins; see the
<a href="/reference/stages" class="yi-link yi-link--default yi-link--underline-auto">stage reference</a> for the checks involved.</p>
<h2 class="yi-heading yi-heading--3xl">Before you start</h2>
<ul>
<li class="yi-markdown__task">
<input checked type="checkbox" aria-label="Completed" disabled="disabled" class="yi-markdown__task-box">The revision passed its build</li>
<li class="yi-markdown__task">
<input checked type="checkbox" aria-label="Completed" disabled="disabled" class="yi-markdown__task-box">A maintenance window is open</li>
<li class="yi-markdown__task">
<input type="checkbox" aria-label="Not completed" disabled="disabled" class="yi-markdown__task-box">Someone is on call for the <del>first hour</del> whole rollout</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="yi-heading yi-heading--3xl">Starting it</h2>
<ol>
<li>Pick the revision to deploy.</li>
<li>Choose the stages it should reach.</li>
<li>Run the command below, or press <em>Deploy</em> in the console.</li>
</ol>
<div class="yi-code-block">
<div class="yi-code-block__header">
<span class="yi-code-block__language">Shell</span>
<span class="yi-code-block__actions">
<button type="button" class="yi-button yi-button--subtle yi-button--sm yi-copy-button yi-button--icon-only" aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="yi-icon">
<path d="M10 8h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-10a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2zM4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
</span>
</div>
<pre tabindex="0" class="yi-code-block__body">
<code class="yi-highlight">
<span class="yi-tok-comment"># Deploys to staging, then waits for approval.</span>
<span class="yi-tok-function">fleet</span> rollout start --revision <span class="yi-tok-number">4f2a91c</span> --until staging</code>
</pre>
</div>
<p>The job file names the image, so a rollout never guesses at it:</p>
<div class="yi-code-block">
<div class="yi-code-block__header">
<span class="yi-code-block__language">HCL</span>
<span class="yi-code-block__actions">
<button type="button" class="yi-button yi-button--subtle yi-button--sm yi-copy-button yi-button--icon-only" aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="yi-icon">
<path d="M10 8h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-10a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2zM4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
</span>
</div>
<pre tabindex="0" class="yi-code-block__body">
<code class="yi-highlight">
<span class="yi-tok-keyword">job</span> <span class="yi-tok-string">"caddy"</span> {
  <span class="yi-tok-property">count</span> = <span class="yi-tok-number">3</span>
  <span class="yi-tok-property">image</span> = <span class="yi-tok-string">"caddy:2.8"</span>
}</code>
</pre>
</div>
<blockquote class="yi-markdown__quote">
<p>A rollout that is paused keeps its place. Resume it with <code class="yi-inline-code">fleet rollout resume</code>
and it carries on from the stage it stopped at.</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 class="yi-heading yi-heading--3xl">Stages</h2>
<div class="yi-table yi-table--open yi-table--wrap">
<div tabindex="0" class="yi-table__scroll">
<table class="yi-table__grid">
<thead>
<tr class="yi-table__row">
<th scope="col">Stage</th>
<th scope="col" class="yi-table__cell--end">Hosts</th>
<th scope="col" class="yi-table__cell--center">Approval</th>
<th scope="col" class="yi-table__cell--end">Typical duration</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="yi-table__row">
<td>Canary</td>
<td class="yi-table__cell--end">2</td>
<td class="yi-table__cell--center">no</td>
<td class="yi-table__cell--end">4 min</td>
</tr>
<tr class="yi-table__row">
<td>Staging</td>
<td class="yi-table__cell--end">9</td>
<td class="yi-table__cell--center">no</td>
<td class="yi-table__cell--end">12 min</td>
</tr>
<tr class="yi-table__row">
<td>Production</td>
<td class="yi-table__cell--end">18</td>
<td class="yi-table__cell--center">yes</td>
<td class="yi-table__cell--end">35 min</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<hr class="yi-divider">
<p>Questions go to <a href="mailto:ops@example.com" class="yi-link yi-link--default yi-link--underline-auto">ops@example.com</a>.</p>
</div>
